# Variant payload equality — recursive comparison via `=`
[Some: [fn [x] x]
 None: [variant "None"]
 r1: [= [Some 42] [Some 42]]
 r2: [= [Some 42] [Some 43]]
 r3: [= None None]
 r4: [= [Some 42] None]]
=== out
Dict({"Some": Function(x), "None": Variant(None, Null), "r1": Bool(true), "r2": Bool(false), "r3": Bool(true), "r4": Bool(false)})
